# Quick controls, the guard: nothing runs on open, on a stray key release, on focus, or on a second tap; only a press and
# release on a button does, and a power button acts at once (no dialog, owner decision 2026-11-23).
# The page opens with the focus on Wi-Fi; a bare Enter RELEASE (the key that opened the tile on the home grid) must do
# nothing. Reboot is started once (the fake service records "Reboot"; the real one runs systemctl reboot -i), the page says
# "Restarting...", every button is dimmed, and more Enter presses start nothing.
# Review only: no golden.
title quick controls power
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_QUICKCTL_ADAPTERS all
apps Settings CLI "Quick controls" SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch "Quick controls"
wait 600
expect_power none
key ENTER release
expect_power none
expect_radio wifi on
expect_radio bt on
key UP
shot qc_focus_on_shutdown
expect_power none
key RIGHT
shot qc_focus_on_reboot
expect_power none
key ENTER
wait 400
shot qc_rebooting
expect_power Reboot
expect_text Restarting...
key LEFT
key ENTER
key ENTER
expect_power Reboot
expect_radio wifi on
expect_radio bt on
